# Raw, unoptimized source character illustrations (~42MB female + ~54MB male) — only the
# generated assets/images/optimized/*.webp and assets/images/faces/*.webp derivatives are used
# by the app and committed. Keep the PNG originals locally (or in a design asset store) instead.
assets/images/*.png
assets/images/male/*.png
